title: arena
speaker: dm
---
The quartermaster waves you at the racks. #line:racks
<<armory racks>>
<<fight first_bout>>
<<if $fight == "lost">>
    You wake on the sand, and the crowd has gone home. #line:lost
<<elseif $fight == "yielded">>
    You raise a hand, and the bout is over. #line:yielded
<<else>>
    The crowd roars. #line:won
<<endif>>
<<xp 250>>
<<level 5>>
<<bark nearby>>
<<roll 1d20 heard>>
<<rest long>>
That is the day's bout. #line:day_over
